[00:01.735]Feel your absence
{"感受你的缺席"}
[00:04.417]In the mornings
{"在每个清晨"}
[00:06.859]Tell me were you ever really here at all?
{"告诉我你是否真的曾存在过"}
[00:11.874]Lost my balance
{"失去平衡"}
[00:14.370]Rain is pouring
{"大雨倾盆"}
[00:16.913]Holding onto nothing never breaks the fall
{"紧握虚无也无法阻止坠落"}
[00:20.714]
[00:20.752]Fought it
{"抗争过"}
[00:22.318]But then we lost it
{"却最终败北"}
[00:24.929]I really bought it
{"我曾深信不疑"}
[00:27.338]That I could be enough
{"自己能够成为你的全部"}
[00:30.302]Exhausted
{"精疲力竭"}
[00:32.387]From treading water
{"在深水中挣扎"}
[00:34.956]I guess you wanted
{"我猜你渴望的"}
[00:37.302]Some kind of faded, shallow love
{"不过是褪色的浅薄爱意"}
[00:41.706]
[00:42.335]Ooooooh oooooh
